( Rockbox Uxn color and screen-device demo )

|00 @System [ &vector $2 &expansion $2 &wst $1 &rst $1 &metadata $2
    &r $2 &g $2 &b $2 &debug $1 &state $1 ]
|20 @Screen [ &vector $2 &width $2 &height $2 &auto $1 &pad $1
    &x $2 &y $2 &addr $2 &pixel $1 &sprite $1 ]

|0100

    ( Four-color Rockbox palette. )
    #0fa5 .System/r DEO2
    #05ff .System/g DEO2
    #0f5a .System/b DEO2

    ( Split the 320x240 screen into four device-fill quadrants. )
    #00a0 .Screen/x DEO2
    #0078 .Screen/y DEO2
    #b0 .Screen/pixel DEO
    #a1 .Screen/pixel DEO
    #92 .Screen/pixel DEO
    #83 .Screen/pixel DEO

    BRK
